LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, 123 S Walnut Street\, Bloomington
DESCRIPTION:Marie Faustin is an NYC-based comedian and actress known for he
 r storytelling skills\, lightning-fast crowd work\, and ability to turn a b
 ad date into a good story. She's been featured in The New York Times \, GQ 
 Magazine \, The Moth \, HBO's The Damn Michael Che \, Ziwe and more. Marie 
 is a crowd favorite at London's Soho Theater and regularly performs for int
 ernational audiences at the world-famous Comedy Cellar in NYC. Marie co-hos
 ts the popular weekly podcast MESS and has also appeared on podcasts like L
 as Culturistas\, Inside the Closet\, Girls Gotta Eat\, and more. She's curr
 ently hosting a dating game show called Why Are You Single? to figure out w
 hat exactly is wrong with us all.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comed
 y-atlas/event/marie-faustin-s-comedy-attic-debut-66251/
